    "turn_text": "Welcome in wins and losses podcast without kick. Appreciate all of you hanging out with us. We've got a special Saturday edition of the podcast today. For a lot of you, there was a wild story on Friday, which illuminated many of the hypocrisy that currently exist in the sporting universe, particularly with the NBA and ESPN and what I would call the woke center universe of the far left wing sports that is trying to take over all of the discussion. And a lot of that centered around Missouri, Senator Josh Hawley, who completely called the NBA and ESPN on their hypocrisy and He's joining us now. Senator, first of all, bravo, because Jason Whitlock and myself have been talking about a lot of the issues that you brought to ahead in a way that frankly, outside of the media, I have not seen. So we'll get into a lot of that. But first, I just want to say thanks for actually taking the step and illuminating what is, to me, a glaring and transparent example of hypocrisy in the world of sports.",
