    "turn_text": "idea and I hear that and he of course wasn't, uh, wasn't there when I was there, but, um, yeah out of the ones who were there when I was around, I would say probably Uh, yeah, just as Thomas and the Chief Justice were the two biggest forces that I knew of. Maybe others were, but I, I didn't, I didn't hear him talk about it, but I heard the Chief and I heard just Thomas talk about him to regular face. It was not uncommon for the Chief Justice to say to us, this group of clerks are here. He'd say, Hey, did you see the game last night? Can you believe, you know, can you believe they missed that field goal? Did you see the putt that tigers, tigers still playing? I guess he's playing again now, but he was his height, uh, then, you know, to see that part of the tiger. That kind of thing. That was pretty common. And of course we would always complain. I'm like, well, we didn't get to any of that chief because you had working. We were, how many hours would you work a day when you were a clerk? Like what was your typical day? It was, you know, it's, it's, of course, make it sound worse than it is. It's the first one thing. It's only a year, you know, and you can a do anything for a year. Indeed. It's such a great experience that you want to soak up. all of it, you know, maybe be an idiot to say, oh, you know, I got to have two weeks of vacation, which probably we did not get. But, you know, you'd be stupid to do that over that experience. But, you know, there were some long days, and then there were some more normal days. The justices, and again, this more than 10 years ago now, I'm",
