  {
    "episode_id": 81053,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/1/81053.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 71,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, 100%. I mean, I just don't think there's any doubt that China is our biggest national security threat, probably our biggest economic threat of this entry and it's going to be like this for the rest of our lifetimes. I don't have any doubt, by the way, who is going to emerge from this as number one. It's going to be us. But we've got some work to do. And this is life, right? I mean, this is part of it. You're going to have people who don't like America, who want to knock America off its pedestal. China's been trying to steal our jobs with some success. Too much success and still are our technology steel our property They've been doing all of that for decades now and I think frankly that the DC Establishment has been asleep at the wheel on this for way too long But we've got some work here to do to stop What China is trying to do what they're trying to take from us stop them from from inserting themselves. They want to be a global Not just a global power. They really want to be the global power. And they see that differently than we do. You know, they see that as they want to control. I mean, them being in charge is them controlling the world and controlling us. And we can't let that happen.",
